{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-views-embedding","title":"Platform Views 嵌入：在 Flutter 中集成原生视图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/platform-views-embedding","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"platform-views-嵌入-在-flutter-中集成原生视图\">Platform Views 嵌入：在 Flutter 中集成原生视图</h1><p>Flutter 的自绘渲染引擎让它可以在所有平台上渲染一致的 UI，但某些原生组件（地图、WebView、摄像头预览）由于技术或协议限制，必须使用原生视图渲染。<strong>Platform Views</strong> 是 Flutter 提供的原生视图嵌入机制，允许在 Flutter Widget 树中嵌入 Android 的 <code>View</code> 或 iOS 的 <code>UIView</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Platform Views</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 嵌入原生视图的通用机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>AndroidView / UiKitView</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 侧使用原生视图的 Widget</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Virtual Display（VD）</strong></td>\n<td>Android 原有嵌入模式，将原生视图渲染到虚拟显示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Hybrid Composition（HC）</strong></td>\n<td>Android 新嵌入模式，原生视图与 Flutter 层真正合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Texture Layer Hybrid Composition（TLHC）</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 3.x 默认的 Android 嵌入模式，性能最佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PlatformViewFactory</strong></td>\n<td>原生侧注册工厂，根据 viewType 创建原生视图实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PlatformViewRegistry</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter Engine 的原生视图注册表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Composition Mode</strong></td>\n<td>原生视图与 Flutter Layer 的合成方式，影响性能和功能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"两端架构\">两端架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph FlutterSide[&quot;Flutter 侧&quot;]&#10;    AV[&quot;AndroidView\\n/UiKitView Widget&quot;]&#10;    PVS[PlatformViewSurface]&#10;    AV --&gt; PVS&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph Engine[&quot;Flutter Engine&quot;]&#10;    PVR[PlatformViewRegistry]&#10;    Compositor[Layer Compositor]&#10;    PVR --&gt; Compositor&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph NativeSide[&quot;原生侧&quot;]&#10;    PVF[&quot;PlatformViewFactory\\n(Kotlin/Swift)&quot;]&#10;    NV[&quot;原生 View\\n(Android View / UIView)&quot;]&#10;    PVF --&gt; NV&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  PVS &lt;--&gt;|viewType + creationParams| PVR&#10;  PVR &lt;--&gt;|创建/销毁| PVF&#10;  Compositor &lt;--&gt;|纹理/层合成| NV\">graph LR\n  subgraph FlutterSide[\"Flutter 侧\"]\n    AV[\"AndroidView\\n/UiKitView Widget\"]\n    PVS[PlatformViewSurface]\n    AV --&gt; PVS\n  end\n\n  subgraph Engine[\"Flutter Engine\"]\n    PVR[PlatformViewRegistry]\n    Compositor[Layer Compositor]\n    PVR --&gt; Compositor\n  end\n\n  subgraph NativeSide[\"原生侧\"]\n    PVF[\"PlatformViewFactory\\n(Kotlin/Swift)\"]\n    NV[\"原生 View\\n(Android View / UIView)\"]\n    PVF --&gt; NV\n  end\n\n  PVS &lt;--&gt;|viewType + creationParams| PVR\n  PVR &lt;--&gt;|创建/销毁| PVF\n  Compositor &lt;--&gt;|纹理/层合成| NV</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"android-三种合成模式对比\">Android：三种合成模式对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>支持触摸</th>\n<th>支持无障碍</th>\n<th>推荐程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Virtual Display（VD）</strong></td>\n<td>渲染到独立虚拟显示器，通过纹理合成</td>\n<td>好（旧默认）</td>\n<td>有限制</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Hybrid Composition（HC）</strong></td>\n<td>原生视图直接嵌入 View 层级</td>\n<td>差（额外帧开销）</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>旧设备兼容用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Texture Layer HC（TLHC）</strong></td>\n<td>HC 变种，通过硬件纹理提升性能</td>\n<td>最好（3.x 默认）</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Flutter 3.x 在 Android 上默认使用 TLHC 模式。可通过以下代码强制指定模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"AndroidView(&#10;  viewType: &#39;com.example/map_view&#39;,&#10;  creationParams: {&#39;apiKey&#39;: mapApiKey},&#10;  creationParamsCodec: const StandardMessageCodec(),&#10;  // 强制指定 Hybrid Composition&#10;  gestureRecognizers: const {},&#10;  onPlatformViewCreated: (id) =&gt; _onViewCreated(id),&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>AndroidView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  viewType: 'com.example/map_view',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  creationParams: {'apiKey': mapApiKey},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  creationParamsCodec: const StandardMessageCodec(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 强制指定 Hybrid Composition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  gestureRecognizers: const {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onPlatformViewCreated: (id) => _onViewCreated(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实现自定义-platform-view\">实现自定义 Platform View</h2><p>以「自定义原生签名板」为例，演示完整实现流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"flutter-侧\">Flutter 侧</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// signature_view.dart&#10;class SignatureView extends StatefulWidget {&#10;  final Function(Uint8List) onSigned;&#10;&#10;  const SignatureView({required this.onSigned, super.key});&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  State&lt;SignatureView&gt; createState() =&gt; _SignatureViewState();&#10;}&#10;&#10;class _SignatureViewState extends State&lt;SignatureView&gt; {&#10;  static const _viewType = &#39;com.example/signature_view&#39;;&#10;  late MethodChannel _channel;&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context) {&#10;    if (defaultTargetPlatform == TargetPlatform.android) {&#10;      return AndroidView(&#10;        viewType: _viewType,&#10;        onPlatformViewCreated: _onViewCreated,&#10;        gestureRecognizers: {&#10;          Factory&lt;EagerGestureRecognizer&gt;(EagerGestureRecognizer.new),&#10;        },&#10;      );&#10;    } else if (defaultTargetPlatform == TargetPlatform.iOS) {&#10;      return UiKitView(&#10;        viewType: _viewType,&#10;        onPlatformViewCreated: _onViewCreated,&#10;        gestureRecognizers: {&#10;          Factory&lt;EagerGestureRecognizer&gt;(EagerGestureRecognizer.new),&#10;        },&#10;      );&#10;    }&#10;    return const Placeholder();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void _onViewCreated(int viewId) {&#10;    _channel = MethodChannel(&#39;${_viewType}_$viewId&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;Uint8List?&gt; captureSignature() async {&#10;    final bytes = await _channel.invokeMethod&lt;Uint8List&gt;(&#39;capture&#39;);&#10;    return bytes;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; clearSignature() async {&#10;    await _channel.invokeMethod&lt;void&gt;(&#39;clear&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// signature_view.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SignatureView extends StatefulWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Function(Uint8List) onSigned;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const SignatureView({required this.onSigned, super.key});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  State&#x3C;SignatureView> createState() => _SignatureViewState();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class _SignatureViewState extends State&#x3C;SignatureView> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static const _viewType = 'com.example/signature_view';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late MethodChannel _channel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (defaultTargetPlatform == TargetPlatform.android) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return AndroidView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewType: _viewType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onPlatformViewCreated: _onViewCreated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gestureRecognizers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          Factory&#x3C;EagerGestureRecognizer>(EagerGestureRecognizer.new),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else if (defaultTargetPlatform == TargetPlatform.iOS) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return UiKitView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewType: _viewType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onPlatformViewCreated: _onViewCreated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gestureRecognizers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          Factory&#x3C;EagerGestureRecognizer>(EagerGestureRecognizer.new),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return const Placeholder();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void _onViewCreated(int viewId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _channel = MethodChannel('${_viewType}_$viewId');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;Uint8List?> captureSignature() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final bytes = await _channel.invokeMethod&#x3C;Uint8List>('capture');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return bytes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> clearSignature() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await _channel.invokeMethod&#x3C;void>('clear');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"android-侧-kotlin\">Android 侧（Kotlin）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// SignatureViewFactory.kt&#10;class SignatureViewFactory(&#10;  private val messenger: BinaryMessenger&#10;) : PlatformViewFactory(StandardMessageCodec.INSTANCE) {&#10;&#10;  override fun create(context: Context, viewId: Int, args: Any?): PlatformView {&#10;    return SignaturePlatformView(context, messenger, viewId)&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class SignaturePlatformView(&#10;  context: Context,&#10;  messenger: BinaryMessenger,&#10;  viewId: Int&#10;) : PlatformView, MethodCallHandler {&#10;&#10;  private val signatureView = NativeSignatureView(context)&#10;  private val channel = MethodChannel(&#10;    messenger,&#10;    &quot;com.example/signature_view_$viewId&quot;&#10;  )&#10;&#10;  init {&#10;    channel.setMethodCallHandler(this)&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  override fun getView(): View = signatureView&#10;&#10;  override fun onMethodCall(call: MethodCall, result: Result) {&#10;    when (call.method) {&#10;      &quot;capture&quot; -&gt; {&#10;        val bitmap = signatureView.exportToBitmap()&#10;        val stream = ByteArrayOutputStream()&#10;        bitmap.compress(Bitmap.CompressFormat.PNG, 100, stream)&#10;        result.success(stream.toByteArray())&#10;      }&#10;      &quot;clear&quot; -&gt; {&#10;        signatureView.clear()&#10;        result.success(null)&#10;      }&#10;      else -&gt; result.notImplemented()&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  override fun dispose() {&#10;    channel.setMethodCallHandler(null)&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SignatureViewFactory.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SignatureViewFactory(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private val messenger: BinaryMessenger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : PlatformViewFactory(StandardMessageCodec.INSTANCE) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun create(context: Context, viewId: Int, args: Any?): PlatformView {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return SignaturePlatformView(context, messenger, viewId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SignaturePlatformView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  messenger: BinaryMessenger,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  viewId: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : PlatformView, MethodCallHandler {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private val signatureView = NativeSignatureView(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private val channel = MethodChannel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    messenger,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"com.example/signature_view_$viewId\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  init {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel.setMethodCallHandler(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun getView(): View = signatureView</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun onMethodCall(call: MethodCall, result: Result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when (call.method) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"capture\" -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val bitmap = signatureView.exportToBitmap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val stream = ByteArrayOutputStream()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bitmap.compress(Bitmap.CompressFormat.PNG, 100, stream)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result.success(stream.toByteArray())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"clear\" -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        signatureView.clear()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result.success(null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else -> result.notImplemented()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun dispose() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel.setMethodCallHandler(null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注册工厂（在 Plugin 或 MainActivity 中）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MainActivity : FlutterActivity() {&#10;  override fun configureFlutterEngine(flutterEngine: FlutterEngine) {&#10;    super.configureFlutterEngine(flutterEngine)&#10;    flutterEngine.platformViewsController.registry.registerViewFactory(&#10;      &quot;com.example/signature_view&quot;,&#10;      SignatureViewFactory(flutterEngine.dartExecutor.binaryMessenger)&#10;    )&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : FlutterActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun configureFlutterEngine(flutterEngine: FlutterEngine) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    super.configureFlutterEngine(flutterEngine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    flutterEngine.platformViewsController.registry.registerViewFactory(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"com.example/signature_view\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      SignatureViewFactory(flutterEngine.dartExecutor.binaryMessenger)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ios-侧-swift\">iOS 侧（Swift）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// SignatureViewFactory.swift&#10;class SignatureViewFactory: NSObject, FlutterPlatformViewFactory {&#10;  private let messenger: FlutterBinaryMessenger&#10;&#10;  init(messenger: FlutterBinaryMessenger) {&#10;    self.messenger = messenger&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  func create(&#10;    withFrame frame: CGRect,&#10;    viewIdentifier viewId: Int64,&#10;    arguments args: Any?&#10;  ) -&gt; FlutterPlatformView {&#10;    return SignaturePlatformView(&#10;      frame: frame,&#10;      viewId: viewId,&#10;      messenger: messenger&#10;    )&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class SignaturePlatformView: NSObject, FlutterPlatformView {&#10;  private let signatureView: NativeSignatureView&#10;  private let channel: FlutterMethodChannel&#10;&#10;  init(frame: CGRect, viewId: Int64, messenger: FlutterBinaryMessenger) {&#10;    signatureView = NativeSignatureView(frame: frame)&#10;    channel = FlutterMethodChannel(&#10;      name: &quot;com.example/signature_view_\\(viewId)&quot;,&#10;      binaryMessenger: messenger&#10;    )&#10;    super.init()&#10;&#10;    channel.setMethodCallHandler { [weak self] call, result in&#10;      guard let self = self else { return }&#10;      switch call.method {&#10;      case &quot;capture&quot;:&#10;        result(self.signatureView.exportToPNG())&#10;      case &quot;clear&quot;:&#10;        self.signatureView.clear()&#10;        result(nil)&#10;      default:&#10;        result(FlutterMethodNotImplemented)&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  func view() -&gt; UIView { signatureView }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SignatureViewFactory.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SignatureViewFactory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NSObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FlutterPlatformViewFactory </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> messenger: FlutterBinaryMessenger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">messenger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: FlutterBinaryMessenger) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.messenger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> messenger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></sp