es github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>AndroidView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  viewType: 'com.example/map_view',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 让原生地图优先接收平移和缩放手势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  gestureRecognizers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Factory&#x3C;OneSequenceGestureRecognizer>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      () => EagerGestureRecognizer(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GestureRecognizer</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>EagerGestureRecognizer</code></td>\n<td>原生视图立即获得所有手势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PanGestureRecognizer</code></td>\n<td>原生视图获得平移手势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ScaleGestureRecognizer</code></td>\n<td>原生视图获得缩放手势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不配置（默认）</td>\n<td>Flutter Widget 优先响应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能影响与优化建议\">性能影响与优化建议</h2><p>Platform Views 会引入额外的渲染开销。以下是优化策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>嵌入视图区域 jank</td>\n<td>合成模式开销</td>\n<td>使用 TLHC（Flutter 3.x 默认）；避免在频繁动画区域使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用高</td>\n<td>原生视图与 Flutter 各维护一份渲染状态</td>\n<td>及时 dispose Platform View；按需懒加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS 透明度问题</td>\n<td>UIView 透明层叠加开销</td>\n<td>避免在 Platform View 上叠加半透明 Flutter Widget</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Platform Views 是 Flutter「自绘引擎」范式下的必要补充，解决了地图、WebView 等无法纯 Flutter 实现的场景。核心原则：<strong>能用纯 Flutter 实现就不用 Platform Views</strong>，因为后者引入了非平凡的性能开销和平台兼容性复杂度。当必须使用时，Android 优先选 TLHC 模式（Flutter 3.x 默认），iOS 使用标准 <code>UiKitView</code>，手势竞争逻辑需要仔细测试。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"custom-render-objects\">自定义 RenderObject</a> — 在 Flutter 内部自定义渲染，不依赖原生</li>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/platform-channels\">Platform Channel 通信</a> — Platform View 内部使用的通信机制</li>\n<li><a href=\"../production/performance-profiling\">性能分析与优化</a> — 检测 Platform Views 的性能影响</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Platform Views 嵌入：在 Flutter 中集成原生视图","id":"platform-views-嵌入-在-flutter-中集成原生视图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两端架构","id":"两端架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Android：三种合成模式对比","id":"android-三种合成模式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实现自定义 Platform View","id":"实现自定义-platform-view"},{"level":3,"text":"Flutter 侧","id":"flutter-侧"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 侧（Kotlin）","id":"android-侧-kotlin"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 侧（Swift）","id":"ios-侧-swift"},{"level":2,"text":"手势竞争处理","id":"手势竞争处理"},{"level":2,"text":"性能影响与优化建议","id":"性能影响与优化建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义 RenderObject：布局与绘制的底层控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/custom-render-objects"},"next":{"title":"Isolates 与 FFI：多核并行与 C/Rust 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/isolates-ffi"}}